# Pages ignores header rules past the first 100 (the limit is per project), and merges
# every matching rule instead of letting a specific one override a wildcard. So held-out
# tools and cheat sheets get exactly one rule each, on the trailing-slash URL that
# returns 200. Indexable pages (the allowlist in src/data/adsenseQualityGate.js) get no
# rule at all. scripts/verifyCloudflarePages.js fails the build above 100 rules.
/cheatsheets/category/
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, follow
  Cache-Control: no-store, max-age=0, must-revalidate

